aragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ\According to all that the LORD commanded Moses, so the children of Israel made all the work.¦layout ªlast_verse*„¥verse+¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙAnd Moses did look upon all the work, and, behold, they had done it as the LORD had commanded, even so had they done it: and Moses blessed them.¦layout ªlast_verse+